# A closed loft held square to a profile: loft_ring.tlspr's smooth loft
# through six circles, its screen shown from the group list, closed into
# a ring by [closed] on its last row, then the third profile's [change]
# given 1; the screen, then the solid checked, a ring with no caps.
file $testdata/ui/loft_ring.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
twmove 137 400
twdown L 137 400
twup L 137 400
twmove 407 330
twdown L 407 330
twup L 407 330
twmove 263 170
twdown L 263 170
twup L 263 170
edit 1
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
dump
